;; Mega Man's training stage (0.4.37, src/game/tutorial/heroes/megaman.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in the
;; Mega Man night-stage look: the buster at an enemy (gate 17), the slide under the low wall, the
;; Helmet from a ? block and a charge shot at the big target (gate 39), up through the brick roof, the
;; Saw Disc at the brick on a diagonal (gate 62), the Leaf Guard against a shooter (gate 73), Rush up
;; the tall wall, the Flame Wave into the trench at the shell (gate 99), the Homing Knuckle at the
;; target on the ledge (gate 113), the Bolt through a screen of enemies (gate 131) and the flagpole.
;; Each power block's item is in [hero-items]; the gates are laid by the tutorial.
id: training-megaman
name: MEGA MAN TRAINING
world: 3
stage: 0
theme: megaman-stage
music: mm-stage-31
time: 400
start: 2,11
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

